<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UNITED COS STARTED AS BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UNITED COS STARTED AS BUY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of United Cos Financial Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Said United Cos &quot;offers an attractive opportunity to participate in the higher margins subprime industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said United Cos is a leader in subprime mortgage lending business and has a valuable retail origination platform.</p>
<p>-- Expects earnings per share to increase nearly 20 percent to $2.97 a share in 1997 and over 20 percent to $3.60 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- United gained 7/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
